# ─── Backend (Laravel /api/v1) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# The only variable the app needs at runtime after the Phase 6 cutover. Point it at a
# local `php artisan serve`, at staging, or leave it empty to use the same origin as the
# SPA (which is what a deployment serving both behind one domain wants).
VITE_API_BASE_URL="http://localhost:8000/api/v1"

# ─── Supabase (legacy — removed in Phase 8) ──────────────────────────────────
# No longer read by any code under src/: userApi.ts, activityTracker.ts and VoiceInput.tsx
# all go through src/lib/apiClient.ts now. Kept until the data migration is signed off so
# the old backend stays reachable for comparison, and because
# src/integrations/supabase/client.ts still constructs a client at import time.
